  "independent_oracles": [
    "Real migration, initialization, accepted activation and owner enrollment precede the actual Rust process and PostgreSQL 16.15 with fsync/full_page_writes on.",
    "Short password issues no login POST; wrong password refuses. Successful login shows the exact seven stored grants, bounded generated client responses and real host-scoped cookie attributes.",
    "Missing CSRF plus cross-origin fetch/form leave complete session/bucket rows and xmin unchanged. Every engine observes the foreign form 403 and exact Origin; Chromium additionally observes both wire 403s via bounded order-independent CDP correlation.",
    "A process restart changes owner epoch while preserving complete session rows before browser /me; the same cookie remains usable. Cross-tab logout removes private facts and permissions from both tabs. Explicit new login/reload/logout succeeds.",
    "With the real process stopped, omit only the start module and its manifest entry in the private bundle copy. Actual startup reports the altered manifest. Browser observes one exact-module 404 and visible recovery notice. Restore exact module and original manifest, restart, then click the real reload link. Every case observes one exact-module 200 only after restoration, enabled login and hidden recovery notice. Both replies carry no-store; no interception or CSP bypass.",
    "Both asset restarts preserve session/bucket rows including xmin. The restored loaded bundle observation equals the original. All six terminal independent SQL observations report one revoked session, one active account, seven grants, config/policy 1, no active Control and zero backends."
  ],
  "review": [
    "Read-only AI review of the fixture tightened exact module URL matching and separated pre/post-restoration 200 counts.",
    "Read-only AI review of the mitigation preserved the Kit default exclusion of font preload by selecting CSS only.",
    "Root reviewed the complete diff and actual captured journeys. The known native WebKit failure at 596d447 is the discriminating runtime predecessor; original failures remain retained.",
    "Independent read-only AI evidence audit verified all 144 capture files, archive/identity hashes and 987 Git source files; six complete browser projections, actual manifest 13->12->13 transitions, independent terminal SQL and preserved resource records match. Full before/after SQL row equality is evidenced by executed fixture assertions, not retained raw snapshots."
  ],
